ined pivot hygiene seat scope quorum retry and the graph signals the stop gates read\"}","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/frontier-nodes.jsonl, lines 1-3\n1: {\"nodeId\":\"F-1-003\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-merge.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/fanout-run.vitest.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/fanout-merge.vitest.ts\"],\"question\":\"Do the fan-out runner and merge handle expansive depth the same way for every executor kind: the round-robin frontier partition, per-lineage derived budgets, lineage prompts carrying focus and frontier scope, lineage command builders and the review coverage merge?\",\"status\":\"open\",\"reason\":null,\"iteration\":0,\"dedupeKey\":\"do the fan out runner and merge handle expansive depth the same way for every executor kind the round robin frontier partition per lineage derived budgets lineage prompts carrying focus and frontier scope lineage command builders and the review coverage merge\"}\n2: {\"nodeId\":\"F-1-005\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/upsert.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-review-ledger-schema\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-research-ledger-schema\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/legacy-projections\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-review-reducers\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-research-reducers\"],\"question\":\"Are the state reducers, upsert, convergence and iteration verification changes correct and free of duplicated logic: node status derivation, dimension coverage, extension bookkeeping, frontier_drained stops and the ledger schema and projection changes?\",\"status\":\"open\",\"reason\":null,\"iteration\":0,\"dedupeKey\":\"are the state reducers upsert convergence and iteration verification changes correct and free of duplicated logic node status derivation dimension coverage extension bookkeeping frontier drained stops and the ledger schema and projection changes\"}\n3: {\"nodeId\":\"F-1-007\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/divergent-pivot.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/scripts/divergent-review-pivot.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/divergent-research-pivot.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/divergent-pivot.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/continuity-thread.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/coverage-graph\"],\"question\":\"Are the divergent pivot, continuity thread and coverage-graph query and signal changes correct and restrained: pivot hygiene, seat scope, quorum retry and the graph signals the stop gates read?\",\"status\":\"open\",\"reason\":null,\"iteration\":0,\"dedupeKey\":\"are the divergent pivot continuity thread and coverage graph query and signal changes correct and restrained pivot hygiene seat scope quorum retry and the graph signals the stop gates read\"}"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/frontier-