grep===\n462:### Expansive Depth Frontier (opt-in)\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-ledger:\nframes\npending\nquarantine\nrecoveries\nstale-locks\n\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-ledger/frames:\n0000000000000001.frame\n0000000000000002.frame\n\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-ledger/pending:\n\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-ledger/quarantine:\n\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-ledger/recoveries:\n\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-ledger/stale-locks:\n\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/logs:\nfanout-lineage.err\nfanout-lineage.out\n===strategy grep===\n462:### Expansive Depth Frontier (opt-in)\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && ls -R specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/logs specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-ledger 2>&1 | head -50; echo \\\"===strategy grep===\\\"; grep -n \\\"Expansive Depth Frontier\\\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md\"}"},"time":{"start"