${pivot.currentFocus} (evidence: ${pivot.artifactRef})`)\n2476:       : ['- Pivot lineage: none yet']),\n2477:     ...(registry.divergence.failed.length\n2478:       ? registry.divergence.failed.map((pivot) => `- Failed ${pivot.pivotId}: ${pivot.reason} (evidence: ${pivot.artifactRef})`)\n2479:       : []),\n2480:     ...(registry.divergence.remainingFrontier.length\n2481:       ? registry.divergence.remainingFrontier.map((candidate) => `- Frontier: ${candidate.focus || candidate.title}`)\n2482:       : ['- Remaining frontier: none recorded']),\n2483:   ];\n2484:   updated = upsertHeadingSectionBefore(\n2485:     updated,\n2486:     '10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER',\n2487:     expansionLines.join('\\n'),\n2488:     '11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS',\n2489:     anchorOptions,\n2490:   );\n2491:   updated = replaceAnchorSection(updated, 'next-focus', '11. NEXT FOCUS', nextFocus, anchorOptions);\n2492:   return updated;\n2493: }\n2494: \n2495: // The frontier metrics only exist once the expansive depth mode projects a\n2496: // frontier, so a default run renders no section at all rather than an empty one.\n2497: function renderFrontierSection(frontier) {\n2498:   if (!frontier || typeof frontier !== 'object') return [];\n2499:   const stats = frontier.stats || {};\n2500:   const nodes = Array.isArray(frontier.nodes) ? frontier.nodes : [];\n2501:   // A visit that covered no new dimension is depth spent again on ground the\n2502:   // run had already walked, which the size and status counts cannot show.\n2503:   const revisits = nodes.reduce((total, node) => {\n2504:     const visits = Number(node?.visits) || 0;\n2505:     const covered = Array.isArray(node?.coveredDimensions) ? node.coveredDimensions.length : 0;\n2506:     return total + Math.max(0, visits - covered);\n2507:   }, 0);\n2508:   const budgetEntries = Object.entries(\n2509:     frontier.budget && typeof frontier.budget === 'object' ? frontier.budget : {},\n2510:   );\n2511:   return [\n2512:     '<!-- ANCHOR:frontier -->',\n2513:     '## 10B. FRONTIER',\n2514:     `- Frontier size: ${stats.total} nodes (${stats.open} open, ${stats.active} active, ${stats.answered} answered, ${stats.exhausted} exhausted, ${stats.blocked} blocked, ${stats.abstained} abstained)`,\n2515:     `- Pruned nodes: ${stats.pruned}`,\n2516:     `- Revisits: ${revisits}`,\n2517:     ...(budgetEntries.length\n2518:       ? budgetEntries.map(([band, entry]) => `- Budget ${band}: ${entry.spent} of ${entry.allotted} iterations spent`)\n2519:       : ['- Budget: not recorded']),\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 2520]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\": 150, \"offset\": 2370, \"path\": \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs\"}"},"time":{"start":1795115201751,"end":1795115202278}}}}
