tep_frontier_budget` setting `maxIterations` from the seed for an expansive run with a defaulted budget.\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/014-docs-playbooks-alignment/scratch/doc-alignment-run-8/report.md:55:- **L2-1** P2 judgment `.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:2378`: The NEVER list still forbids `modify_config_after_initialization` outright, but the workflow rewrites the config after init in the two steps this topic adds: `step_extend_completed_run` (line 467) writes `maxIterations: newMaxIterations` and `maxDurationMinutes` (line 548), and `step_frontier_budget` (line 775) writes `maxIterations: budget.derivedMaxIterations` (line 798). The runtime then reads ...\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/014-docs-playbooks-alignment/scratch/doc-alignment-run-8/report.md:56:  - Evidence: `rg -n \"modify_config_after_initialization|step_frontier_budget:|step_extend_completed_run:|maxIterations: budget.derivedMaxIterations|maxIterations: newMaxIterations\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/dee...` exit 0: 467: step_extend_completed_run: 548: maxIterations: newMaxIterations, 775: step_frontier_budget: 798: fs.writeFileSync(tmp, JSON.stringify({ ...config, maxIterations: budget.derivedMaxIterations }, null, 2) + \"\\n\"); 2378: - modify_config_after_initialization\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/014-docs-playbooks-alignment/scratch/doc-alignment-run-8/critic.prompt.md:175:      \"issue\": \"The NEVER list still forbids `modify_config_after_initialization` outright, but the workflow rewrites the config after init in the two steps this topic adds: `step_extend_completed_run` (line 467) writes `maxIterations: newMaxIterations` and `maxDurationMinutes` (line 548), and `step_frontier_budget` (line 775) writes `maxIterations: budget.derivedMaxIterations` (line 798). The runtime then reads the rewritten value: `seedBudget` takes the floor from `config.maxIterations` (frontier-admit.cjs:308) and `convergence.cjs` takes the iteration cap from `config.maxIterations` (convergence.cjs:1397). A reader who follows the rule literally skips both writes, so an expansive run keeps the defaulted budget and an `--extend=N` run keeps its old cap. The same class was already corrected in deep-research/SKILL.md and state-format.md, which now name the three permitted writes.\",\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/014-docs-playbooks-alignment/scratch/doc-alignment-run-8/critic.prompt.md:177:        \"cmd\": \"rg -n \\\"modify_config_after_initialization|step_frontier_budget:|step_extend_completed_run:|maxIterations: budget.derivedMaxIterations|maxIterations: newMaxIterations\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml\",\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/014-docs-playbooks-alignment/scratch/doc-alignment-run-8/critic.prompt.md:179:        \"out\": \"467:      step_extend_completed_run:\\n548:              maxIterations: newMaxIterations,\\n775:      step_frontier_budget:\\n798:              fs.writeFileSync(tmp, JSON.stringify({ ...config, maxIterations: budget.derivedMaxIterations }, null, 2) + \\\"\\\\n\\\");\\n2378:    - modify_config_after_initialization\"\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/014-docs-playbooks-alignment/scratch/doc-alignment-run-6/critic.prompt.md:533:        \"out\": \"567:            const next = {\\n568-              ...config,\\n569-              status: \\\"initialized\\\",\\n570-              maxIterations: newMaxIterations,\\n571-              maxDurationMinutes: newMaxDurationMinutes,\\n572-              lineageMode: \\\"completed-continue\\\",\\n573-              continuedFromRun,\\n574-            };\"\nspecs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mo