\"thought\":   continue    // invisible to stuck counter\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:238:- `thought`: Skipped entirely -- analytical iterations produce no evidence to measure.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:258:Averages the last 2 severity-weighted `newFindingsRatio` values from evidence-bearing iterations (excludes `thought` status). Votes STOP when the average drops below `rollingStopThreshold` (0.08).\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && grep -rn \\\"thought\\\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/ .skilled/commands/deep/review.md 2>/dev/null | head -10\"}"},"time":{"start":1795115500391,"end":1795115500841}}}}
