ather than reported.\\n- Iteration 2: treating the duplicated frontier visit/marker code across the two reducers as an overengineering finding failed the two-instance test in `prevent-overengineering.md` section 4; recorded as a ruled-out direction instead.\", \"oldString\": \"## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n- Iteration 1: treating the local review packet as an operator-owned directory left stale `*.jsonl` store files at the lineage root (audit and effect ledgers) with no reader; do not re-open generated bookkeeping there.\\n- Iteration 2: the first read of the extension step looked like `maxIterations += N` was missing from a duration-symmetry rule; the checkpoint and AC-004 ruling showed the count-plus-N rule is deliberate, so the direction was dropped.\", \"path\": \"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1795115534664,"end":1795115536472}}}}
