{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795116059720,"sessionID":"ses_e0acc529fffetdTx9mE3m9n6Pl","part":{"partID":"prt_1f541476b002gJ81BnBMRd5zCb","sessionID":"ses_e0acc529fffetdTx9mE3m9n6Pl","messageID":"msg_1f5413c13001yi6faW7UjaqewM","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-90430c3126c6743e","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Iteration 6: reading the pivot config parser beside its writer confirmed the persistence contract is strict; the graph query path's allowlist and parameter binding closed the metadata and SQL surfaces.\n- Iteration 7: checking the feature catalog and playbooks against the fan-out code showed the catalog agrees with the implemented pivot handoff, which narrows the iteration 3 finding's fix to the packet text.","oldString":"- Iteration 6: reading the pivot config parser beside its writer confirmed the persistence contract is strict; the graph query path's allowlist and parameter binding closed the metadata and SQL surfaces.","path":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md\