ion (writes no frontier node) matches the code and makes R3-P1-001 a packet-text fix.', iteration: 9 },\\n  { type: 'ruled_out', direction: 'A new catalog finding for the pivot sentence', reason: 'It matches the code and is the evidence that the acceptance row is stale.', iteration: 9 },\\n  { type: 'ruled_out', direction: 'A Windows-path finding for the quality-class playbook', reason: 'The code advisory R5-P2-001 already carries it; the playbook omission is its doc side.', iteration: 9 },\\n  { type: 'ruled_out', direction: 'Retry parity drift between the two loops', reason: 'Both YAMLs and both mode scripts carry the same one-time retry rule.', iteration: 9 }\\n];\\nfs.writeFileSync(dir + '/deltas/iter-009.jsonl', [rec, ...rows.map((row) => JSON.stringify(row))].join('\\\\n') + '\\\\n');\\nNODE\\nnode .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode review --run-directory specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek --event-json specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/logs/iter-009-event.json; echo \\\"GATEWAY_EXIT:$?\\\"; node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode --artifact-dir specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek --create-missing-anchors; echo \\\"REDUCER_EXIT:$?\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1795116146267,"end":1795116148339}}}}
